        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    initial_investment = 250000\n    end_year_value = 320000\n    management_fee_rate = 0.04\n    incentive_fee_rate = 0.12\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    profit = end_year_value - initial_investment\n    management_fee = end_year_value * management_fee_rate\n    incentive_fee = profit * incentive_fee_rate\n    net_end_year_value = end_year_value - management_fee - incentive_fee\n    annual_return = (\n        (net_end_year_value - initial_investment) / initial_investment\n    ) * 100\n    answer = round(annual_return, 1)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
